  "body": "Brand-new, north-facing and ready to move in! Set on a generous 339m² freehold section,\r\nthis beautifully designed home offers modern comfort, plenty of sunshine and room to enjoy\r\nthe outdoors.\r\n\r\nFeatures You Will Love\r\n\r\n• 3 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms, including master ensuite and walk-in wardrobe\r\n• Sunny, north-facing living with seamless indoor-outdoor flow\r\n• Contemporary kitchen with island bench and gas cooking\r\n• Family bathroom with freestanding bath\r\n• Spacious deck and generous backyard\r\n•Separate laundry with washing tub\r\n• Heat pump for year-round comfort\r\n• Off-street parking with flexibility for a boat or caravan\r\n• Title and CCC issued - ready to move in\r\n• 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n• Convenient to Orewa Beach, schools, shops and cafés\r\n\r\nOne Community. Multiple Homes. One Easy Tour!\r\n\r\nWhy spend your weekends going from one open home to another?\r\nWe have a great selection of brand-new homes throughout Strathmill, offering different\r\nlayouts, sizes and features to suit your lifestyle and budget.\r\n\r\nContact Brianna and Brian to book your personalised Strathmill Home Tour and explore\r\nmultiple homes in one convenient visit.\r\n\r\nViewing Directions: Access via Flavell Road, or GPS to 251 West Hoe Heights, Orewa,\r\nand follow the Strathmill signs to 7 Harakeke Lane.",
